7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33264, 32014, 7)</a>. There is a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Warning%20Sign\"><img alt=\"Warning Sign\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Sign_eb3d89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Warning%20Sign\">Warning Sign</a> at the entrance of the cave:<br/>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">Citizens, beware: Don't drink from the pond! Survivors tend to hallucinate strongly and tell of strange gardens infested with evil tree creatures.<br/><br/>- The Magistrate of Cormaya</span></dd></dl>\n<p>The Dryad Gardens is also one of the spots you have to cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Main_Floor\">Main Floor</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\"><img alt=\"Rabbit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rabbit_d384db.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\">Rabbit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_per